  "title": "duckduckgo-tool-raise-valueerror",
  "request": "The DuckDuckGoSearchTool currently raises a generic Exception when there are no results. Can we change it to raise a ValueError with the same message? That would make error handling clearer.",
  "edits": [
    {
      "path": "src/smolagents/default_tools.py",
      "search": "raise Exception("No results found! Try a less restrictive/shorter query.")",
      "replace": "raise ValueError("No results found! Try a less restrictive/shorter query.")"
    }
